For Streams, we have the following metods:

Method                    Finite?          Notes

Stream.empty()             YES         Creates a Stream with zero elements.

Stream.of(varargs)         YES         Creates a Stream with elements listed.

coll.stream()              YES         Creates a Stream from a COLLECTION.

coll.parallelStream()      YES         Creates a Stream from collection where
                                       the Stream can run in parallel.

Stream.generate()           NO         Creates a Stream bu calling Supplier for
                                       each element upon request.

                                        Creates a Stream by using seed for
 Stream.iterate             NO          first element and then calling
(seed, unaryOperator)                   UnaryOperator for each subsequent
                                        element upon request.

                                        Creates Stream by using seed for first
Stream.iterate(seed,      YES/NO        element and then calling UnaryOperator for each
predicate, unaryOpreator)               subsequent element upon request. Stops if
                                        Predicate returns false.
